BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 249.90 Tm (records twice. Keep clinical documents in an encrypted object store and pass opaque references through the queue. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 234.67 Tm (chapter's 13-play working map comprises consent capture, evidence ingestion, identity reconciliation, fraud triage,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 219.45 Tm (retainer handoff, record request orchestration, retrieval recovery, chronology extraction, evidence crosschecking,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 204.22 Tm (exception routing, fee reconciliation, referral distribution, and identity_graph_pixel_arbitrage. These are) Tj ET
