BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 173.77 Tm (voluntary-data implementation described below. Assign the full-time operator to queue ownership, vendor) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 158.55 Tm (management, and billing reconciliation. Assign three contractors to intake exceptions, record retrieval, and clinical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 143.32 Tm (abstraction quality checks, with coverage schedules rather than assumed full-time availability. The retained law firm) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 128.10 Tm (owns engagement decisions, substantive legal screening, and advertising interpretation. Record every handoff with a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 112.87 Tm (named owner, deadline, and disposition so automation never becomes an unattended inbox.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 97.65 Tm (Use TrustedForm certificates as evidence of the capture experience, subject to the product's actual retention and access) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 82.42 Tm (terms; a certificate does not establish identity, case merit, or permission for every downstream use. Store the displayed) Tj ET
