BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (LexisNexis product and document its contractual permissible-use restrictions. Avoid collecting full SSNs unless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (necessary for an authorized workflow. Compare protected identifiers inside a restricted matching service, not inside an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (advertising account or model prompt. Duplicate retainer detection requires the firm's authorized matter index and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (claimant confirmation; an identity vendor cannot reveal every existing representation. Similar names, recycled) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (telephone numbers, family addresses, and changed surnames create false matches. Route conflicts to staff for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (verification and correction, preserving the original evidence. Never automatically reject a person merely because a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (vendor risk score or incomplete identifier crosses a configurable threshold.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (Measure the 70% target against a frozen inventory of repetitive administrative tasks, weighted by observed manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (minutes. An illustrative cohort contains 10,000 baseline minutes; 7,300 minutes of work complete without staff touch,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (while exceptions and required checks consume the remaining 2,700 equivalent baseline minutes. That is 73% touchless) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (coverage, not a claim that lawyers' judgment or all company labor disappears. Track actual review minutes separately) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (because poor extraction can make nominal automation slower than manual work. Count a task as completed only after) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (its required evidence and terminal status exist. A failed vendor request, retried webhook, or draft chronology awaiting) Tj ET
